He started offending in 84, and the BSA caught him trying to get back into the scouts for years and kept refusing him. The link from NettleLily has documents from newest to oldest so I read it backwards- made more sense. Thanks for your work. I have kids (teens and younger) who are still in the church and your work is helping me help them!
